# data/ holds the fidelity test corpus (data/test-docs/, data/wide-corpus/),
# which is checked in. A local server's own runtime state is not, wherever it
# happens to run from (repo root, or apps/server/ during `npm run dev:server`):
# its database, secrets and log. **/ makes these match at any depth, not just
# the repo root, since a second copy of them under apps/server/data/ is what
# this rule missed the first time it was written.
**/.admin-password
**/.llm-secret-key
**/docforge.db
**/docforge.db-*
data/*/roundtrip/
data/*/rt2/
data/*/out/
data/wide-corpus/report.txt
